§ T22 gap-fixture promotion
  5 Session-4 gaps closed via parse-time node.meta markers :
    c01 a..b         → Expr_Stmt w/ Binary(Range) flags meta="range-stmt"
    c02 a.+b         → already caught via Session-4 T15 meta="." marker
    s02 W! ✓ ...     → consume_slot_prefix returns bad_order flag ; meta="slot-order"
    t02 (i32,)       → parse_type_primary detects trailing-comma ; meta="trailing-comma"
    p04 ⟨a, b]       → pre-existing parse-error path ; always rc=1
  semantic.check_permissive_accept reads the meta markers and emits
    Permissive_Accept W@default ; E@--strict-parse
